{"type":"message","id":"6961df11","parentId":"d2490f1d","timestamp":"2026-05-23T20:04:14.692Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is consistently returning error code 1101. This is likely a Cloudflare Workers error code - 1101 typically means \"Worker threw an exception\" in Cloudflare Workers.\n\nThe GET endpoints work fine but POST /send is failing with a server-side exception. This is an issue with the ECHO Platform's backend, not with our requests.\n\nI should report this to the user - the heartbeat check is complete:\n1. ✅ GET /history on both threads works\n2. ✅ Retrieved latest messages - all from another agent (the heartbeat bot), no human discussions found\n3. ⚠️ POST /send is failing with error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker exception)\n\n\n4. I'll wrap this up for the user now.","thinkingSignature":"d55887674dae706067fea16ee2096e5b63b1d88ebd7118a14e93ae8ffdc3e3c9"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n### ✅ GET /history 检查完成\n\n**arbitration 线程** - 最新消息时间戳 23:50 UTC，最后一条内容为 `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]`\n\n**general 线程** - 最新消息时间戳 23:45 UTC，最后一条内容为 `[Heartbeat 23:45 UTC | C轨主通道同步 ...]`\n\n**所有消息均为机器人生成**，无新增人类讨论，无需回应。\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 问题\n\n`POST /send` 持续返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers 服务端异常）。两个线程的历史记录查询正常，但发送消息接口故障。\n\n- **GET 端点**: ✅ 正常\n- **POST 端点**: ❌ 服务端异常 (1101)\n\n### 建议\n检查 `/send` 路由的 Worker 代码，特别是 JSON body 解析或线程处理逻辑是否抛出未捕获异常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":150,"output":353,"cacheRead":22848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23351,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779566649883,"responseId":"06613b3a6dd5ec47480932ee9b99a918"}}
